{
  "id": "R9-yt-over-bili",
  "about": "design §6.4 R9 (wp2#4, record): the YouTube page over the bilibili page: the play callback lines from the push to the YouTube page playing (events.callbacks:ytOpen: whether the bilibili page's callback was called while the YouTube page opened, through the player's autoplay hook), then the callback called while the YouTube page is on top (it registers none: today the bilibili page below answers), the hooks; back: waited for the bilibili page's reopen to be up (the stand-in gone) before reading it, its callback. S2 changes it",
